    "title": "<p>Clinical characteristics of sporadic versus von Hippel&ndash;Lindau syndrome (VHL)-associated haemangioblastoma</p>",
    "legend": "",
    "source": "",
    "copyright": "Reprinted from: Louis DN, Ohgaki H, Wiestler OD, et al., editors. WHO classification of tumours of the central nervous system. Lyon (France): International Agency for Research on Cancer; 2016. (WHO classification of tumours series, 4th rev. ed.; vol. 1). https://publications.iarc.fr/543.",
    "tablehtml": "<table class=\"MsoTableGrid\" style=\"border-collapse: collapse; border: none;\" border=\"1\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"width: 166.45pt; border: none; border-top: solid black 1.0pt; background: #8DB3E2; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"222\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong>Characteristic</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 166.45pt; border: none; border-top: solid black 1.0pt; background: #8DB3E2; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"222\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\"><strong>Sporadic</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 166.45pt; border: none; border-top: solid black 1.0pt; background: #8DB3E2; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"222\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\"><strong>VHL-associated</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"width: 166.45pt; border: none; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"222\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong>Female sex</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 166.45pt; border: none; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"222\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\">41%</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 166.45pt; border: none; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"222\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\">56%</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"width: 166.45pt; border: none; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"222\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong>Median patient age</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 166.45pt; border: none; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"222\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\">44&nbsp;years (range: 7&ndash;82&nbsp;years)</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 166.45pt; border: none; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"222\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\">23&nbsp;years (range: 7&ndash;64&nbsp;years)</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"width: 166.45pt; border: none; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"222\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong>Intracranial location</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 166.45pt; border: none; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"222\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\">79%</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 166.45pt; border: none; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"222\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\">73%</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"width: 166.45pt; border: none; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"222\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong>Spinal location</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 166.45pt; border: none; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"222\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\">11%</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 166.45pt; border: none; background: #DAEEF3; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"222\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\">75%</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"width: 166.45pt; border: none; border-bottom: solid black 1.0pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"222\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong>Multiple haemangioblastomas</strong></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 166.45pt; border: none; border-bottom: solid black 1.0pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"222\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\">5%</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 166.45pt; border: none; border-bottom: solid black 1.0pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"222\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\">65%</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>",
    "imageUrl": null,
    "thumbnail": null
  },
